THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
====================
Structure coordinates are fetched at view time from the RCSB Protein Data Bank
(https://www.rcsb.org/) and are not redistributed in this repository. The 3-D
viewer is 3Dmol.js (https://3dmol.csb.pitt.edu/), loaded from a CDN under its
own licence. All cited papers remain the property of their publishers; this
repository reproduces only bibliographic metadata and short factual claims.
